  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 845738,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "'Allo 'Allo! Cartoon Fun! transports players to occupied France during World War II, based on the beloved BBC comedy series. This vibrant platform arcade romp delivers a hilarious and addictive experience. Join our heroes on a wacky quest to recover both genuine and fake lost art treasures, navigating through huge, multi-level environments with full 360-degree scrolling.\n\nPrepare to be captivated by fully animated backgrounds featuring impressive 8-layer parallax effects and a spacious stereo soundtrack boasting over 900K of music and sound effects. The game supports both single-player and simultaneous two-player action, alongside engaging difference game variations. Encounter a cast of cartoon characters, each brimming with unique and humorous styles, all brought to life with stunning graphics exceeding one megabyte.  Experience madcap humour, thrilling action, and addictive gameplay in this unforgettable cartoon caper!"
    },
